/// The compiled token grammar of exactly one inventory
/// release, or `null` when the release is pending or unknown.
/// Never substitutes a neighbour or the unversioned pair
/// (LANG84 C4.3).
TokenGrammar? perlReleaseTokenGrammar(String release) =>
    _tableByRelease[release];

/// The deduplicated class holding a release's table, or
/// `null` for a release without one. Two releases share a
/// class exactly when their compiled token grammars are equal
/// apart from line numbers.
String? perlGrammarClass(String release) => _classByRelease[release];
